Chancery court judges-district and circuit
HB0054
court assistance.
Sponsored By: Joint Judiciary Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to courts; authorizing the assignment of cases and proceedings
from circuit courts and district courts to chancery court judges; specifying
requirements for transfers; authorizing retired chancery court judges to provide
judicial service as specified; making conforming amendments; and providing for
an effective date.
